    family-names: Franco
    alias: gufranco
repository-code: https://github.com/gufranco/zilog-z80-python
url: https://github.com/gufranco/zilog-z80-python
abstract: >-
  A model of the Zilog Z80 and its CMOS descendants, the processor at the centre of a
  generation of home computers and arcade boards. Every documented instruction, flag
  rule, machine cycle and pin transition is settled against recorded states and against
  the manufacturer's own manual rather than against its author's confidence, and nothing
  in it starts from a clean machine, because silicon powers up holding whatever it holds.
keywords:
  - emulation
  - z80
  - zilog
  - processor
  - hardware-model
  - conformance
  - cycle-accurate
